Z||000004||batboy||12-02-1999||04:45 PM||||You want a pic of my ugly, filthy, stock Batmobile engine? Well then, I'd better degrease it and clean it up some first. I have a set of fancy stainless steel braided plug wires I bought but never install. I'll try and get off my butt and do that.<P>I also asked a lady friend of mine if she would pose next to my car for a pic and said yes, then told me she didn't have a good swim suit to wear. I had to laugh, it's way to cold for outdoor bikini photos this time of year. She decide to wear a tight sweater and mini-skirt instead.<P>If I can get the Batmobile back on the road this weekend and if she don't back out of the deal, I soon hope to have a cheesecake pic of my Fiero. With a pretty girl in front of the Batmobile, maybe the car won't look quite so plain.||||reg||1
