Z||000030||batboy||12-10-1999||10:55 PM||||Why is everyone suddenly bashful about showing off their cars? Plenty of the members have cars much more beautiful than my plain little Batmobile. I would of guessed that you'd have enough photos for two years worth of calendars by now.<P>I was thinking maybe of instead of one big pic, maybe doing the Batmobile pics as a collage, or maybe one main pic and three smaller ones. The smaller pics could be an engine and/or interior photo, etc. Or does everyone prefer to be uniform and just have one pic per month?<P>Time's a wasting, let's get motivated!||||reg||1
