Z||000054||Wolfhound||01-07-2000||05:03 PM||||Scott, I had emailed for two but set me up for three. I have a friend who wants one.<BR>Coy ||||reg||1
Z||000055||Scott2M4||01-22-2000||11:22 AM||||<B>THE CALENDAR IS FINISHED AND READY TO SHIP!</B><P>Final price ended up being $7.  Now, there's the question of ... shipping.  The PO will ship it priority mail for $3.20.  There's also first class (not sure what it'll be exactly but I'm thinking something like $1.00 for one, $2.00 for two, etc.).<P>Send your payment to:<P>Scott Haas<BR>320 West Market Street<BR>Springboro, Ohio 45066<P>With your payment, send your preferred method of shipment (make sure your payment reflects this).  If there's another method you'd prefer, just let me know in advance.<P>I've never done anything like this before so I hope this seems fair to everyone.<P>Comments/questions/concerns, please email me privately.||||reg||4
