Z||000064||Scott2M4||01-24-2000||08:23 PM||||Thought I'd post the final "reserved" list.  I had a total of 30 calendars to sell.  Here's the breakdown (unless noted, one calendar was reserved for each):<P>fiero56 (2)<BR>superXmotorsports<BR>cooter (2)<BR>sdm1964<BR>sluppy123<BR>dano<BR>batboy (3)<BR>DaRkLoRD<BR>turbo86se<BR>Monkeyman<BR>Wolfhound (3)<BR>Steven<BR>ditz88gt (3)<BR>Bill Osmer (2)<BR>ChadMan<BR>jhogans (2)<BR>kel<BR>bHooper<BR>overlord<BR>88 Database Nut<P>Each calendar is individually sealed in shrink wrap with a chipboard backing.  One end is fastened together with a GBC comb.  The other end has a single centered hole for hanging.||||reg||1
