Z||000072||Scott2M4||02-02-2000||08:04 AM||||Wow!  I'm glad all of you are pleased with the product.  I was worried it wouldn't turn out well due to the time I had to spend on it.  I'll have to give my wife much of the credit.  She did a great job on the printing and came up with the idea to use shrink wrap and clip board.<P>At this point, I'm planning to do a 2001 version.  I've already got my list of "things to do differently" started and drafts are being created as we speak.<P>In the next few days, I'll start a 2001 thread that outlines what my plans are and what I need from all of you.  Watch for it ...<P>Thanks again for the nice comments.  They're greatly appreciated!<P>BTW, I still have several "reserved" calendars waiting to be sent to their new homes ...||||reg||1
